<section class="section faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="shell faq-grid">
    <div class="faq-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2>Questions are <em>welcome.</em></h2><p>We want you to feel informed before you decide to get involved.</p><a href="mailto:cwforg25@gmail.com?subject=Question%20about%20education%20support" class="text-link">Ask us anything <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details><summary>Where does the education program work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Change the World Foundation–Uganda is based in Gulu City and works with vulnerable children, youth and households in Northern Uganda. Contact us for current program locations and priorities.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What will my contribution pay for?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>That depends on the current needs and the support plan we agree together. We discuss the intended use before a contribution is made; we don’t advertise unverified fixed amounts or guarantees.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I support a specific learner or activity?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Please get in touch. We’ll explain what is appropriate and possible, while respecting learner privacy and the needs identified with the community.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How can I learn about progress and accountability?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Ask us for the current activity plan, available updates and the best way to follow up on a partnership. We aim to communicate clearly about what support is intended to do.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I visit, volunteer or partner as an organization?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes—tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss fit, timing, safeguarding and practical arrangements directly.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
